{"seq":1,"slug":"inference-scaling","title":"推理时扩展","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-reasoning-test-time-compute/test-time-compute/inference-scaling","wordCount":1788,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"推理时扩展\">推理时扩展</h1><p>2024 年 DeepMind 的一篇论文给出一个让整个行业重新算账的结论：在某些任务上，与其把训练预算翻 14 倍换一个更大的模型，不如把这笔钱花在让小模型在推理时多想一会儿——后者更划算。这把「测试时计算」从一堆零散技巧（<a href=\"../foundations/self-consistency\">自洽与采样</a>、<a href=\"../search-planning/tree-of-thoughts\">思维树</a>）提升为一条可量化的扩展律。本文专讲「花多少算力、怎么花最划算」的扩展规律；如何把这种花法训练进模型见 <a href=\"reasoning-models-rl\">推理模型与强化学习</a>，给路径打分的验证器见 <a href=\"verification-self-correction\">验证与自我纠错</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>测试时计算扩展（test-time / inference-time scaling）指的是：固定模型权重，通过在推理时生成更多 token、采样更多路径或进行更深的搜索，来换取更高的准确率。它被称为继预训练扩展、后训练扩展之后的「第三条扩展律」。三条扩展律的对照是理解全局的钥匙。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[提升模型能力的三条扩展轴] --&gt; B[预训练扩展&lt;br/&gt;更多参数+数据+算力]&#10;  A --&gt; C[后训练扩展&lt;br/&gt;更多RL/对齐算力]&#10;  A --&gt; D[测试时扩展&lt;br/&gt;推理时花更多算力]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[采样更多: best-of-N]&#10;  D --&gt; D2[搜索更深: 束搜索/树搜索]&#10;  D --&gt; D3[思考更长: 长链推理]&#10;  B --&gt; E[训练成本一次性&lt;br/&gt;推理成本不变]&#10;  D --&gt; F[训练成本不变&lt;br/&gt;推理成本随每次查询上升]\">flowchart TD\n  A[提升模型能力的三条扩展轴] --&gt; B[预训练扩展&lt;br/&gt;更多参数+数据+算力]\n  A --&gt; C[后训练扩展&lt;br/&gt;更多RL/对齐算力]\n  A --&gt; D[测试时扩展&lt;br/&gt;推理时花更多算力]\n  D --&gt; D1[采样更多: best-of-N]\n  D --&gt; D2[搜索更深: 束搜索/树搜索]\n  D --&gt; D3[思考更长: 长链推理]\n  B --&gt; E[训练成本一次性&lt;br/&gt;推理成本不变]\n  D --&gt; F[训练成本不变&lt;br/&gt;推理成本随每次查询上升]</pre><p>三条轴的成本结构截然不同：预训练把成本压在一次性的训练上、推理时近乎免费；测试时扩展则相反——训练成本不变，但每一次查询都要为「多想」付费。这决定了它们各自的适用场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"怎么花-几种扩展机制\">怎么花：几种扩展机制</h2><p>测试时算力可以用在不同地方，下表对比主流机制及其代价画像。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>怎么花算力</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Best-of-N</td>\n<td>采样 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 条，用验证器选最优</td>\n<td>简单、并行、易扩展</td>\n<td>需要好的验证器，否则选错</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多数投票（自洽）</td>\n<td>采样 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 条，答案投票</td>\n<td>无需验证器</td>\n<td>仅适用可投票答案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>束搜索</td>\n<td>维护 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 条最优部分解逐步扩展</td>\n<td>聚焦高潜路径</td>\n<td>需过程级评分器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>树搜索</td>\n<td>在思维树上扩展评估回溯</td>\n<td>能回溯、解难谜题</td>\n<td>开销最大、控制复杂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长链推理</td>\n<td>让模型一条链里想更久</td>\n<td>无需外部编排</td>\n<td>易过度思考、难控时长</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这些机制可分成两族：一族是「并行」扩展——同时跑多条独立尝试再聚合（best-of-N、投票）；另一族是「串行」扩展——在一条或一束推理上逐步深化（束/树搜索、长链）。并行扩展易于实现且天然并行，但浪费在重复探索；串行扩展信息利用更充分，但难以并行、且长链有自身的稳定性问题。2026 年前沿系统往往二者混用：在一条长链内串行深思，同时并行采若干条长链再选优。</p>\n<h2 id=\"计算最优-把钱花在刀刃上\">计算最优：把钱花在刀刃上</h2><p>「测试时扩展更划算」不是无条件成立的，关键概念是计算最优（compute-optimal）：在固定的总算力预算下，最优的分配方式取决于问题难度。</p>\n<p>直觉是这样：对模型本就「踮踮脚够得着」的中等难度题，让它多采样、多搜索能稳定地把对的答案捞出来，测试时算力回报极高；但对模型「无论如何都想不出」的超难题，再多测试时算力也无济于事——这时该把钱花回预训练/后训练，提升模型的基础能力上限。形式地，给定预算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，要在「更大的模型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span>」与「更多的测试时计算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>」之间分配，使期望准确率最大：在易、中题上 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 的边际收益高，在难题上 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 的边际收益高。</p>\n<p>这也解释了为什么 <a href=\"../foundations/self-consistency\">自洽与采样</a> 里准确率随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 收益递减：对一道题，测试时算力的回报存在天花板，越过甜区后每多花一份算力买到的正确率越少。聪明的系统会按题目难度自适应地分配预算——简单题少想、难题多想，而非一刀切。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预算怎么分-一个决策对照\">预算怎么分：一个决策对照</h2><p>「测试时扩展更划算」要落到具体决策，核心是判断手头这道题属于哪一类，再把预算投向边际收益最高的一侧。下表给出一个大致的分配口径。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>题目相对模型能力</th>\n<th>测试时算力的边际收益</th>\n<th>建议分配</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>简单（本就稳对）</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>几乎不必扩展，省下算力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中等（踮脚够得着）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>主力投向这里：多采样、多搜索、长思考</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>困难（怎么想都不会）</td>\n<td>近零</td>\n<td>扩展无用，应把预算投回训练/换更强模型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>形式化地说，给定总预算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，要在「更大模型」的边际增益与「更多测试时计算」的边际增益之间求均衡。设准确率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(\\theta, T)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（模型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span>、测试时算力 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>），最优点满足两条边际曲线相等：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfrac><msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">∣</mo><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mfrac><msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">∣</mo><mi>T</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial T}\\Big|_{\\theta} = \\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial \\theta}\\Big|_{T}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0712em;vertical-align:-0.6997em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.15em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.8em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.8em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1800\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v600 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-600 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v600 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.65em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:-0.2136em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.0003em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0712em;vertical-align:-0.6997em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.15em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.8em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.8em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1800\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v600 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-600 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v600 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.65em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:-0.2214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.0003em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对中等难度题，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\partial f/\\partial T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 陡峭而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\partial f/\\partial \\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 平缓，于是加测试时算力更划算；对超难题恰好相反。这正是「计算最优」在工程上的可操作形态：不是无条件多花，而是按题难度把预算挪到收益最高的那一侧。</p>\n<h2 id=\"行业影响与现实约束\">行业影响与现实约束</h2><p>测试时扩展正在重塑 AI 的成本结构。分析普遍预计，2026 年起推理算力需求将大幅超过训练——有估计称到 2026 年推理对算力的需求可达训练的上百倍量级，到 2030 年推理或将占据总 AI 算力的大头。原因正是推理模型「每答一题都生成数量级更多的 token」，把过去几乎免费的推理变成了主要成本中心。</p>\n<p>但这条扩展律有硬约束。其一是延迟：多想意味着用户要等更久，对交互式应用是直接的体验代价。其二是边际成本：与训练的一次性投入不同，测试时算力对每一次查询都要重复付费，规模化后总账可能很贵。其三是回报的不确定性：测试时扩展的收益高度依赖一个好的验证器或评分器来「选对」——这正是 <a href=\"verification-self-correction\">验证与自我纠错</a> 的主题；没有可靠验证，best-of-N 可能选出一个自信但错误的答案。理解这三条约束，才能判断一个任务到底该不该、该花多少测试时算力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>测试时扩展是第三条扩展律：固定权重，用推理时的更多采样/搜索/更长思考换准确率，成本结构与预训练相反（按查询付费）。</li>\n<li>扩展机制分并行族（best-of-N、投票）与串行族（束/树搜索、长链），前者易并行但有重复浪费，后者信息利用足但难并行，前沿常混用。</li>\n<li>计算最优指出最优分配取决于题目难度：中等题测试时算力回报高，超难题该把预算投回训练——这也解释了自洽的收益递减。</li>\n<li>测试时扩展正使推理算力反超训练，但受延迟、按次付费的边际成本、以及对可靠验证器的依赖三重约束。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"推理时扩展","id":"推理时扩展"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"怎么花：几种扩展机制","id":"怎么花-几种扩展机制"},{"level":2,"text":"计算最优：把钱花在刀刃上","id":"计算最优-把钱花在刀刃上"},{"level":2,"text":"预算怎么分：一个决策对照","id":"预算怎么分-一个决策对照"},{"level":2,"text":"行业影响与现实约束","id":"行业影响与现实约束"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"规划与任务分解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-reasoning-test-time-compute/search-planning/planning-decomposition"},"next":{"title":"推理模型与强化学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-reasoning-test-time-compute/test-time-compute/reasoning-models-rl"}}